WEBVTT

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:45.530
<i>THE KINGDOM OF AQUAFA.</i>

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:50.240
<i>THE REALM WAS ONCE RAVAGED BY THE
MILITARY STRENGTH OF THE EMPIRE OF ZOL.</i>

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.990
<i>HOWEVER...</i>

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:55.460
<i>FRIGHTENED BY AN OUTBREAK OF
THE MYSTERIOUS BLACK WOLF FEVER,</i>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:59.960
<i>ZOL CALLED OFF ITS IMMINENT INVASION
OF AQUAFA'S SACRED FIRE HORSE VILLAGE.</i>

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:04.010
<i>DESPITE COUNTLESS LATER SKIRMISHES,
THE VILLAGE NEVER FELL.</i>

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:07.970
<i>AT PRESENT, THE TWO REALMS
HAVE BEEN LOOSELY MERGED TOGETHER.</i>

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:16.520
<i>TODAY, THE FEVER
IS THOUGHT TO BE NO MORE...</i>

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:07.900
Work as if Death spared you!
That is why we let you live!

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.860
Be quick about it!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:23.500
What did I just tell you?!

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.300
Keep it down!
Silence that brat!

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:34.260
No rest, worm!
On your feet!

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.220
I said get up!

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:54.780
H-How dare you!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.580
What the...?!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.620
Ossam dogs!

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.540
Stay back!

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:48.880
No!

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.510
Husband, dear.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.100
Safe travels.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.570
Don't go...

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.620
The sun...

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:14.890
I've survived yet again...

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.090
Mama?

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:46.510
Mama...

00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:38.100
That way!

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.030
A pyuika...

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:59.420
THE DEER KING

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.890
What a tragic sight.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.730
They say Aquafa loyalists did this?

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:26.110
We Aquafaese yielded to
the Empire of Zol 10 years ago.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.740
Our loyalty to you remains steadfast.

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.910
I am aware.

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.530
He has arrived.

00:10:32.740 --> 00:10:36.790
Tohlim, I hear you once
supervised this salt mine?

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:38.250
Indeed.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:40.920
I want you to guide someone.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:47.260
Halt, halt!
Entry is forbidden!

00:10:47.920 --> 00:10:51.930
Insolent fool! Do you not know
who he is?! This is...

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:55.260
Enough, Makokan.
Do not make a scene.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.430
Who are you?!

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:00.950
- You're standing before...

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:01.940
- Don't make that face...

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:03.020
Stand down!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.900
Lord Yotalu...

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:12.950
Thank you for coming.
Please lift your heads.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:17.240
This is Tohlim. The King of Aquafa's
right-hand man.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:24.080
I am Hohsalle Yuguraul.
Pleasure to meet you.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:30.300
To meet Sir Hohsalle,
one of the sacred doctors,

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:32.380
is a great honor.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.220
The honor is mine.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:40.230
Your ever-reliable political acumen
is most impressive.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.600
Sarcasm, perhaps?

00:11:43.810 --> 00:11:44.900
Heavens, no.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:52.200
Lord Yotalu, please hold off on
cremating the bodies.

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:53.610
What for?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:56.200
I'd like to inspect as many as I can.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:00.040
That is why I came all this way.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:08.170
S-Stop! That boundary is sacred!

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.180
Bring the mikimu.

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:19.010
So that's Sir Hohsalle?

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:22.180
The priest-doctors lose out to
Zol's physician.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:26.480
Especially after he saved
Lord Yotalu's mother.

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:30.190
The second empress...
That would win trust.

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.340
Sir Hohsalle.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:54.910
Yeah, bring them here.

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:55.260
Yes, sir.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.230
Please look.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.400
Ossam dogs like those
that attacked the falconry party?

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.360
Yes. Along with such bite marks,

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:20.280
I have patients who
also bear these lesions.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:26.540
You mean to say my elder brother
suffers from the same disease, do you?

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:29.880
I kept quiet as
I'd lacked clear evidence...

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:34.210
But this is black wolf fever.
The mittsual.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:38.970
The mittsual?!

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:44.520
The dead are all Zolians?

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:47.270
Zolian condemned criminals, I'm told.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:50.480
This place is sacred to Aquafaese,

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:53.820
so I saw to it that
they do not work here.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:58.360
The stench is mild. Seems the
bodies below are in better condition.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.280
May I take some back to the capital?

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:04.240
The priest-doctors will surely object...

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.500
But, very well. I'll see to it.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:16.920
Fear not. She is with us.
I asked her to inspect the place first.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.930
Well?

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:25.020
Someone made it out alive.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:30.190
Could a human smash through this?

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:33.360
Seems he was bitten on the arm by a dog.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:38.990
He collapsed here, then rose,
broke out, and went that way.

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:40.780
Hey! I asked you if...

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:42.620
Quiet, Makokan.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.790
A chain was dragged here.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.700
There are bloodstains...

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.630
but the footprints suggest he was
not dragged out by the ossam dog.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.840
He left on his own feet.

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:03.510
Are you sure this man
was bitten by a dog?

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:08.810
There was a large pool of blood here.
Judging by its shape, it's likely...

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.560
Meaning what?

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:16.650
If he was bitten yet still survives,

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.530
it is likely he has
antibodies against the mittsual.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:25.660
So if we had him,
we could find a cure?

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:30.500
To be precise, if we had his blood,
and luck on our side...

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.120
Get the name
of the slave from this cell!

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:33.880
Yes, sir.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:57.400
The same mittsual that wiped out

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:03.030
the once-invincible Zolian army
in mere days, eh?

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.080
<i>We found the escapee's name.</i>

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:12.250
<i>Van, of the Gansa clan.</i>

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.210
Van? Where was he taken prisoner?

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:20.050
At the Revolt of Kashuna Lake.

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:23.590
"Broken Antler" Van...
of the Lone Antlers!

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.640
Lord Yotalu!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.560
Where is he?! Lord Yotalu!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.290
So, he lives...

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:55.120
An Aquafaese was down there?

00:16:57.170 --> 00:17:02.710
That woman will find him.
She is the best tracker in the land.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:03.760
Can you?

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:07.750
Surely.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.680
Be sure to capture him alive.

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:12.770
As you wish.

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:18.940
You heard him.
Bring the man back alive.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:23.610
That will not be so easy.

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:28.320
<i>He is a surviving member of
the elusive Lone Antlers...</i>

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:35.120
Wait! Come back!

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:41.340
Hey, you!
How can you ride my pyuika?!

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:47.470
Wow. I'd never seen anybody
ride one before.

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:49.510
Talk about a shock.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:53.850
A pack of ossam dogs came
flooding out from deep in the forest.

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:57.980
That pyuika
slipped its reins and ran,

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.690
and my cart flipped over on me to boot.

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:06.150
Anyway...at least the ossam
didn't eat that beast.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:11.240
The Zolian army's offering
good money for pyuika, you see.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.700
I'm trying to breed 'em,

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:17.330
but it sure ain't easy.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:20.790
Mine are wild,
and won't obey me at all.

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:24.630
Why do the Zolians
want such ornery critters?

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:25.880
Yum!

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:29.090
It's fahmu. Zolian food.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:32.930
My wife baked them.
Good, right?

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:37.100
Well, guess it's ’cause
in the last war

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:42.270
the Zolians couldn't cope with
Aquafaese pyuika riders.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:49.240
Ya know,
you're really somethin'.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:53.490
I thought buyin' a female
would calm the ones I have down,

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:56.290
so I spent what little
I had on that one...

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:58.500
She is already with child.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:01.120
Really?!

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:01.920
Really.

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:07.050
Pyuika are a mystery to me.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:13.090
Guess I had a lucky break.
Or is it thanks to this little goddess?

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:14.770
Yunacha!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:15.740
Yunacha?

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:17.470
Yuna.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.640
That is her name.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:24.980
Call me Tohma!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:28.940
I am Van.

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:32.160
Yuna and Van, huh?
Mighty obliged!

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:38.160
Speaking of ossam, you hear some recently
attacked the Zolian lord's falconry party?

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:42.290
<i>Whatever's happening,
it doesn't bode well.</i>

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:47.250
Is it true?
They are all dead?

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:50.510
Slaves and soldiers,
600 in total.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:53.180
Killed by lowly ossam dogs?

00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:55.470
According to Sir Hohsalle...

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.970
...it was the mittsual.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.400
The Aquafaese curse.

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.520
In my grandfather's era,

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:12.200
Zolian troops who stormed this land
fell prey to the disease.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.450
It's said to be the retribution
of the Aquafaese they killed.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:22.370
Is it mere coincidence it has returned
before the Emperor's Eyes' Visit?

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:26.920
This talk of a curse
is archaic superstition.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:32.470
We Aquafaese pledged loyalty
10 years ago. We would never...

00:20:32.630 --> 00:20:34.680
What of Aquafaese?

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:38.350
Did any die in the salt mine?

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:39.760
- Well...

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.350
- None did. But, Brother...

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:51.360
Tohlim...

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:59.870
Loyal servant of Aquafa's king.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.420
Lick my wound.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:13.420
Prove there is no curse by
contracting the mittsual as an Aquafaese.

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:17.050
If you so wish...

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.190
Brother!

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:34.190
Sir Hohsalle!

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:43.580
Herbs will not help at this point.

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:44.790
What can?

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:48.460
Anti-poison made from
the diluted blood of the fallen.

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:54.460
No! His imperial blood
must not be sullied by a commoner's!

00:21:54.590 --> 00:21:57.050
Leave his survival to fate!

00:21:57.180 --> 00:21:59.010
Bodies are mere vessels!

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:01.760
Tainting his soul would be...

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:03.630
- ...absurd!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.630
- I need nothing!

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:07.850
I shall heal myself
without such things!

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:13.860
Well said! It is imperative
that your soul remains pure.

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:26.620
I shall not die...
I shall not die!

00:22:31.670 --> 00:22:37.260
Is it true that only Zolians contract
the mittsual and not Aquafaese?

00:22:37.840 --> 00:22:39.880
Well, some books do say that...

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:41.640
Something wrong?

00:22:42.300 --> 00:22:45.180
Tohlim seemed strangely calm.

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:49.640
Well, surely diseases
do not target countries.

00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:55.780
This Emperor's Eyes' Visit
business is overblown.

00:22:55.940 --> 00:23:00.780
Fire Horse Village may be sacred, but why
must the emperor personally travel so far?

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:05.490
The mittsual once forced them
to retreat from there.

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:10.370
They must wish to reshape history
and dispel fear of the disease.

00:23:10.870 --> 00:23:15.460
Even so, the timing of
the mittsual's return is ironic.

00:23:15.630 --> 00:23:18.800
The Emperor's Eyes' Visit
may be the cause.

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:19.970
How so?

00:23:20.180 --> 00:23:23.300
Use your head,
retired swordsman.

00:23:26.260 --> 00:23:31.850
The falconry and salt mine incidents
went according to plan.

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:36.860
If Yotalu succeeds him,
Zol will be easier to control.

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:38.690
This augurs well.

00:23:39.320 --> 00:23:43.820
Nevertheless, we should not
rush our next move.

00:23:43.990 --> 00:23:45.160
Are you afraid?

00:23:45.830 --> 00:23:51.120
The Emperor's Eyes’ Visit will reach
my Fire Horse Village by spring.

00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:52.870
Be patient.

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:56.710
An Aquafaese was in the mine.

00:23:58.380 --> 00:24:02.590
We must maintain secrecy.
Proceed cautiously.

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:06.100
I take no orders from minions of Zol.

00:24:06.390 --> 00:24:11.100
Ohfan, is there a reason
for your impatience?

00:24:14.900 --> 00:24:16.690
This is concerning.

00:24:16.820 --> 00:24:21.530
<i>Will he truly act
according to our wishes?</i>

00:24:21.740 --> 00:24:25.570
<i>He and his village
are merely our pawns.</i>

00:24:25.740 --> 00:24:31.250
<i>The mittsual is their last lifeline.
They cannot act rashly.</i>

00:24:32.710 --> 00:24:36.380
<i>What of the salt mine survivor?</i>

00:24:37.040 --> 00:24:39.550
<i>A tracker is on his tail.</i>

00:24:40.050 --> 00:24:41.760
<i>To what end?</i>

00:24:42.220 --> 00:24:43.970
<i>Leave the matter to me.</i>

00:24:44.470 --> 00:24:50.640
An Aquafaese's life or the future of
this land. What will you choose, my King?

00:24:53.180 --> 00:24:54.270
Checkmate.

00:24:58.730 --> 00:25:02.240
Naturally, I choose
the future of this land.

00:25:03.070 --> 00:25:04.450
As you wish.

00:25:15.250 --> 00:25:18.630
<i>I think he had a small child with him.</i>

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:21.670
Oh, and a young man with an accent, too.

00:25:22.920 --> 00:25:24.420
Ah, the guy with the pyuika!

00:25:41.650 --> 00:25:43.110
Hey!

00:25:43.820 --> 00:25:46.280
Hey, I'm back!

00:25:47.160 --> 00:25:48.280
Tohma!

00:25:50.780 --> 00:25:52.290
Kiya!

00:26:05.720 --> 00:26:07.180
Hm? Yeah.

00:26:11.430 --> 00:26:14.220
They thank you for saving me.

00:26:17.520 --> 00:26:22.150
Sorry. They can't speak
till they've drank with you.

00:26:24.440 --> 00:26:26.570
Yeah! Good idea!

00:26:28.030 --> 00:26:32.370
If ya work here,
we'll supply food and shelter.

00:26:33.160 --> 00:26:36.750
Good, it's a deal!
Van knows pyuika well.

00:26:37.460 --> 00:26:39.330
He'll be a big help.

00:26:43.670 --> 00:26:47.840
Well, enough with the formalities.
Let's drink!

00:26:55.470 --> 00:27:00.730
That hit the spot! Drink up!
No point in sticking to tradition.

00:27:02.270 --> 00:27:07.360
Cute little tyke. You don't look
much alike. She take after your wife?

00:27:08.110 --> 00:27:09.200
Oh my!

00:27:10.950 --> 00:27:12.990
Say, where is your wife?

00:27:14.870 --> 00:27:16.910
Oh, tender subject?

00:27:20.460 --> 00:27:21.920
Coming to me?

00:27:31.590 --> 00:27:34.350
Ah, of course.
You like Daddy's lap.

00:27:35.970 --> 00:27:37.140
Dada?

00:27:40.230 --> 00:27:43.310
Hey, hey.
No milk from Daddy's chest!

00:27:43.560 --> 00:27:45.820
Give her your finger.

00:27:56.160 --> 00:27:58.950
You want milk now too, son?

00:27:59.870 --> 00:28:02.420
Shall we eat?

00:28:05.040 --> 00:28:09.460
His fever's back.
Also, his breathing is shallow...

00:28:15.350 --> 00:28:18.850
What is it?
Herbs are not filling enough?

00:28:22.100 --> 00:28:25.610
Please save me, merciful gods...

00:28:53.010 --> 00:28:54.590
Are you alright?

00:28:54.930 --> 00:28:55.680
Yeah.

00:28:56.850 --> 00:29:00.680
"To learn of countries,
ourselves, and diseases"...

00:29:01.020 --> 00:29:05.980
We Yugurauls have long served leaders
with our medical expertise.

00:29:07.360 --> 00:29:13.450
Caught between Aquafa and Zol,
what can I possibly learn of the disease?

00:29:14.360 --> 00:29:15.860
Boy, I'm starving!

00:29:16.870 --> 00:29:18.990
Let's go have some nice rabbit.

00:29:20.990 --> 00:29:22.580
L-Lord Utalu is...

00:29:36.430 --> 00:29:41.600
<i>Lord Yotalu, should we postpone
the Emperor's Eyes' Visit?</i>

00:29:42.060 --> 00:29:44.310
We reported my brother's death,

00:29:44.890 --> 00:29:47.900
but the emperor had
already crossed the border.

00:30:02.120 --> 00:30:05.540
<i>What must I learn about the mittsual?</i>

00:30:06.670 --> 00:30:08.250
<i>The man in the mine.</i>

00:30:25.930 --> 00:30:27.560
Hey, where's Dada?

00:30:28.140 --> 00:30:30.900
Hmm, haven't seen him for a while.

00:30:50.710 --> 00:30:51.920
Found some.

00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:54.210
Asshimi.

00:31:37.800 --> 00:31:38.800
- Father!

00:31:38.090 --> 00:31:38.800
- Dada!

00:31:40.340 --> 00:31:41.260
You...

00:31:43.300 --> 00:31:44.600
I found you!

00:31:45.760 --> 00:31:47.560
Why are you here?

00:31:49.060 --> 00:31:51.810
Because I can see you, Dada.

00:31:55.570 --> 00:31:57.190
It's so pretty.

00:31:57.320 --> 00:31:59.690
Pretty? The asshimi?

00:32:00.360 --> 00:32:03.070
Yeah. It's pretty.

00:32:20.800 --> 00:32:26.390
What's the point of erecting this?
Pyuika can leap it easily.

00:32:29.060 --> 00:32:31.520
Hey! It isn't safe here!

00:32:35.690 --> 00:32:36.730
I'll help!

00:32:37.650 --> 00:32:41.150
Doing this will leave
the scent of asshimi.

00:32:46.660 --> 00:32:50.450
That's Olaha.
It means "born at daybreak."

00:32:50.700 --> 00:32:54.210
An old and stubborn one.
Too hard to handle!

00:32:58.210 --> 00:33:00.550
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:33:03.510 --> 00:33:05.140
Surely he won't...

00:33:37.380 --> 00:33:39.750
He's amazing, ain't he?

00:33:39.920 --> 00:33:44.260
He'll bring us that
sweet Zolian army money!

00:33:44.470 --> 00:33:46.220
You greedy fool...

00:34:44.530 --> 00:34:45.940
My leg!

00:34:48.570 --> 00:34:51.660
Van! It went that way!

00:34:52.910 --> 00:34:53.830
Dada!

00:35:41.290 --> 00:35:44.250
Well done, Van!
Mighty impressive!

00:35:44.340 --> 00:35:45.250
Wow!

00:38:26.750 --> 00:38:27.710
Now what?

00:38:27.830 --> 00:38:29.040
I'm gonna drink it!

00:38:29.210 --> 00:38:30.210
You can drink that?

00:38:32.880 --> 00:38:34.380
You've got talent.

00:38:34.510 --> 00:38:35.090
Yeah!

00:38:35.630 --> 00:38:38.050
I always did it for Mama.

00:38:38.180 --> 00:38:39.760
You don't say?

00:38:40.470 --> 00:38:43.770
Pyuika milk?
Just like old times.

00:38:44.810 --> 00:38:49.060
When I was a child,
I fought my siblings over it.

00:38:49.650 --> 00:38:51.820
I'd completely forgotten.

00:38:52.570 --> 00:38:56.820
Years ago, the Zolian army
ran riot here too,

00:38:56.900 --> 00:39:00.280
and we never saw pyuika again.

00:39:00.450 --> 00:39:05.000
Even just the mention of Zol
sent us into hiding.

00:39:05.700 --> 00:39:10.580
Then about 10 years ago,
pyuika riders called the Lone Antlers

00:39:10.710 --> 00:39:15.170
became Aquafa's guardians
and battled the fierce Zolians.

00:39:15.300 --> 00:39:19.590
Thanks to them,
Zol entered a treaty with us,

00:39:19.720 --> 00:39:24.140
and now our wonderful Zolian wives
bake fahmu for us.

00:39:24.260 --> 00:39:25.270
For you, lady!

00:39:25.640 --> 00:39:28.310
None for me, thank you.

00:39:28.810 --> 00:39:33.860
Drinking beasts' milk turns you
into a beast, say the Zolians.

00:39:34.650 --> 00:39:40.490
Long ago, while hunting, I saw
a herd of pyuika attacked by wolves.

00:39:41.240 --> 00:39:46.490
One fawn was not quick enough,
and got left in front of the wolves.

00:39:47.620 --> 00:39:53.630
Then an old buck leapt forward,
and stomped around to provoke them.

00:39:54.090 --> 00:39:57.380
An act befitting the Deer King.

00:39:57.710 --> 00:40:04.050
Did saving the fawn and vanishing into
the forest injured make that buck a hero?

00:40:04.800 --> 00:40:10.190
Or was it simply strong-legged,
and did what was required of it?

00:40:11.140 --> 00:40:12.690
It seemed so to me.

00:40:13.310 --> 00:40:16.900
The men of the Lone Antlers
all died, I hear.

00:40:21.610 --> 00:40:23.570
Will you leave alone?

00:40:26.950 --> 00:40:29.120
Yuna. Want to ride?

00:40:29.660 --> 00:40:30.370
Yeah!

00:40:41.630 --> 00:40:42.430
Giddy-up!

00:41:01.190 --> 00:41:02.360
What are those?

00:41:03.110 --> 00:41:04.360
Pasque flowers.

00:41:04.910 --> 00:41:06.030
And that?

00:41:06.740 --> 00:41:08.080
A bush cricket.

00:41:09.620 --> 00:41:10.790
And that?

00:41:12.710 --> 00:41:14.040
A white-tailed eagle.

00:41:16.880 --> 00:41:18.880
Well then... What's this?

00:41:22.170 --> 00:41:23.260
Dada!

00:41:26.760 --> 00:41:28.310
And what's this?

00:41:28.390 --> 00:41:29.390
Yuna.

00:41:30.770 --> 00:41:33.230
You know everything!

00:41:36.480 --> 00:41:38.320
You like it here?

00:41:38.610 --> 00:41:39.730
Here?

00:41:40.150 --> 00:41:42.240
You like Tohma and his people?

00:41:42.570 --> 00:41:44.110
I do! The lady too!

00:41:45.610 --> 00:41:46.340
I see...

00:41:48.330 --> 00:41:49.620
I like you too!

00:42:04.760 --> 00:42:06.760
I'll make you a deer whistle.

00:42:23.440 --> 00:42:26.070
A pyuika? How rare.

00:42:27.320 --> 00:42:31.080
He's gonna make me a deer whistle!

00:42:31.330 --> 00:42:32.290
He is?

00:42:34.370 --> 00:42:36.120
Yuna, we must go.

00:42:36.210 --> 00:42:37.040
Okay.

00:42:50.680 --> 00:42:51.970
Where are you headed?

00:43:04.730 --> 00:43:08.450
May this realm become
safe for orphans too.

00:43:46.990 --> 00:43:48.150
Found you.

00:44:05.090 --> 00:44:06.340
Heave-ho!

00:44:06.420 --> 00:44:10.130
Quick, quick!
Van'll get ahead of us!

00:44:15.100 --> 00:44:18.430
Huh, that's unusual.
A Zolian.

00:44:28.320 --> 00:44:29.320
Stop!

00:44:32.950 --> 00:44:34.120
What is it?!

00:44:36.580 --> 00:44:37.790
Dogs...

00:44:38.500 --> 00:44:40.790
Black dogs...

00:44:45.250 --> 00:44:46.960
What's up?

00:44:47.750 --> 00:44:48.510
Stay back!

00:44:52.760 --> 00:44:56.100
The mittsual hit another Zolian village?

00:44:57.100 --> 00:44:58.140
And?

00:44:58.310 --> 00:44:59.810
No inquest at all.

00:45:00.100 --> 00:45:04.810
The priest-doctors burned the bodies and
prayed for three days and nights.

00:45:06.110 --> 00:45:08.480
It cannot be a curse.

00:45:09.820 --> 00:45:15.240
<i>Think, Hohsalle. Why does it
distinguish between Zol and Aquafa?</i>

00:45:15.370 --> 00:45:18.290
Sir Hohsalle!
S-Success at last!

00:45:18.490 --> 00:45:22.710
Hey, we're in a library.
A mittsual cure has been found?

00:45:23.080 --> 00:45:25.170
Yes! Er, no.

00:45:25.960 --> 00:45:29.960
The Lone Antler...
The salt mine escapee was!

00:45:30.130 --> 00:45:31.130
What?!

00:45:32.760 --> 00:45:38.010
That tracker woman sent word.
Tohlim took troops to catch him.

00:45:38.180 --> 00:45:39.600
Tohlim himself has gone?

00:45:40.600 --> 00:45:43.270
Prepare! We shall chase the old man.

00:45:43.440 --> 00:45:44.140
Yes, sir?

00:45:45.060 --> 00:45:46.480
This bodes badly...

00:45:48.480 --> 00:45:54.490
<i>I hear lots about the resentment of Zol
lately. It is said the gods sent the ossam</i>

00:45:54.910 --> 00:45:59.530
<i>and Lord Utalu's death
was punishment for scorning Aquafa.</i>

00:46:27.600 --> 00:46:32.780
There is no Aquafa or Zol.
We're all one family.

00:46:33.400 --> 00:46:34.610
Indeed.

00:46:36.030 --> 00:46:38.570
This is our home.

00:46:38.950 --> 00:46:42.620
We chose to live on this land.

00:46:47.040 --> 00:46:47.960
What is it?

00:46:48.880 --> 00:46:49.960
Watch Yuna.

00:46:50.960 --> 00:46:51.920
What?

00:46:52.000 --> 00:46:55.760
Listen, I forced you to shelter me.
Tell them that.

00:46:55.880 --> 00:46:57.880
Wait! Van!

00:47:14.070 --> 00:47:16.030
Van of the Lone Antlers?

00:47:16.570 --> 00:47:18.780
These people know nothing.

00:47:19.110 --> 00:47:22.450
If you spare them,
I shall surrender.

00:47:24.120 --> 00:47:25.120
Very well.

00:47:31.330 --> 00:47:33.040
The Lone Antlers...?

00:47:33.670 --> 00:47:34.960
Dada?

00:47:35.460 --> 00:47:36.970
Where's Dada?!

00:47:38.170 --> 00:47:39.470
Dada!

00:47:40.180 --> 00:47:41.260
Stay there.

00:47:44.430 --> 00:47:45.720
You scoundrel!

00:47:45.930 --> 00:47:47.230
Dada!

00:47:57.240 --> 00:47:59.320
Van! What's this Lone Antlers stuff?!

00:48:00.360 --> 00:48:02.320
What have you done, Van?!

00:48:02.620 --> 00:48:05.290
It...briefly turned into a tree...

00:48:06.790 --> 00:48:07.790
Dada!

00:48:08.250 --> 00:48:09.830
Come quietly!

00:48:16.170 --> 00:48:17.960
When'll you be back?

00:48:18.420 --> 00:48:20.970
Dada, when'll you be back?

00:48:44.660 --> 00:48:46.200
<i>Got you...</i>

00:48:48.500 --> 00:48:49.500
Dogs!

00:48:49.620 --> 00:48:51.210
We're surrounded!

00:48:52.330 --> 00:48:53.920
What in the world?!

00:48:55.000 --> 00:48:58.510
Fear not! Aquafaese are
immune to the mittsual!

00:49:02.130 --> 00:49:03.680
Ohfan...

00:49:09.100 --> 00:49:13.190
<i>Why fight it?
Give in to it.</i>

00:49:15.860 --> 00:49:16.620
Dada!

00:49:16.760 --> 00:49:17.490
No!

00:49:17.570 --> 00:49:19.570
Da...da?

00:49:28.790 --> 00:49:29.950
<i>Yuna...</i>

00:49:39.750 --> 00:49:40.550
Yuna!

00:49:53.730 --> 00:49:54.770
Van!

00:49:56.350 --> 00:49:57.180
- Yuna!

00:49:56.970 --> 00:49:57.440
- Fool!

00:50:03.360 --> 00:50:04.360
<i>Zol...</i>

00:50:20.500 --> 00:50:22.460
Tohma! For Van!

00:50:27.300 --> 00:50:28.930
I'm countin' on ya!

00:50:43.280 --> 00:50:44.650
What was that?!

00:50:44.740 --> 00:50:45.990
Any casualties?

00:50:46.280 --> 00:50:48.620
He's in the forest!
After him!

00:50:48.740 --> 00:50:50.780
Let's go! Get the horses!

00:51:10.720 --> 00:51:12.640
<i>Get a grip, Van...</i>

00:51:17.730 --> 00:51:18.900
<i>I know...</i>

00:51:22.690 --> 00:51:23.900
<i>...who I am!</i>

00:51:42.500 --> 00:51:44.300
Yu...na...

00:52:26.760 --> 00:52:27.760
Outta my way.

00:52:34.760 --> 00:52:36.010
For Aquafa!

00:52:38.020 --> 00:52:39.430
Yuna...

00:52:47.860 --> 00:52:49.030
Stop there.

00:52:56.740 --> 00:52:57.620
Halt!

00:52:58.330 --> 00:53:00.500
Hey! Halt, I said!

00:53:12.840 --> 00:53:16.390
No! Sir Hohsalle!
Step away!

00:53:21.810 --> 00:53:24.190
Good grief, what's with this guy?

00:53:24.350 --> 00:53:26.980
Makokan, lead Tohlim's men away.

00:53:27.900 --> 00:53:31.490
They must not kill him.
You can see that!

00:53:31.610 --> 00:53:36.660
But... I cannot see that,
but I shall see to it!

00:53:36.910 --> 00:53:39.330
Do not take unnecessary risks!

00:54:01.220 --> 00:54:02.390
You're home!

00:54:03.140 --> 00:54:04.890
My dear husband.

00:54:10.530 --> 00:54:12.360
Why fight it?

00:54:13.780 --> 00:54:15.200
Give in to it.

00:54:17.530 --> 00:54:20.160
Do you not feel the wind howl?

00:54:21.160 --> 00:54:25.830
The grass and flowers?
Birds? Beasts?

00:54:26.420 --> 00:54:31.250
You now feel all forms of life,
and are at one with them.

00:54:33.920 --> 00:54:35.680
That is Inside Out.

00:54:36.180 --> 00:54:37.430
Inside Out?

00:54:37.550 --> 00:54:41.600
Yes. The power you now possess.

00:54:41.890 --> 00:54:42.890
Yuna!

00:54:43.060 --> 00:54:44.140
Come.

00:54:44.230 --> 00:54:48.270
Come to me.
My name is Kenoi.

00:55:04.450 --> 00:55:07.460
Tohlim wants rid of that man's blood?

00:55:09.040 --> 00:55:12.750
He believes Aquafaese
are immune to the mittsual.

00:55:13.550 --> 00:55:16.220
I suspect he has a hand in the outbreak.

00:55:16.680 --> 00:55:20.760
Like 80 years ago, the mittsual
must be being used to repel Zol

00:55:21.010 --> 00:55:24.140
and give Aquafa hope
of gaining independence,

00:55:25.100 --> 00:55:29.440
but there is no guarantee
it will remain an ally.

00:55:30.520 --> 00:55:33.280
Zolians killed my family.

00:55:33.900 --> 00:55:35.940
The disease is retribution.

00:55:37.030 --> 00:55:38.610
So killing that man is justified?

00:55:46.580 --> 00:55:47.620
Desist!

00:55:48.710 --> 00:55:51.330
Stop. You're too hurt to be moving around.

00:55:58.130 --> 00:56:02.180
See? With your wounds,
moving around is impossible.

00:56:02.640 --> 00:56:05.520
I am a doctor.
Lie down for now.

00:56:05.640 --> 00:56:07.520
Forget that woman.

00:56:10.150 --> 00:56:13.110
Listen! We need you alive.

00:56:15.190 --> 00:56:18.280
Thank you.
You bandaged me?

00:56:18.820 --> 00:56:21.820
Do not thank me.
I only want your blood.

00:56:23.030 --> 00:56:24.780
I made a promise.

00:56:26.910 --> 00:56:27.950
Wait!

00:56:28.790 --> 00:56:30.540
I must find Yuna...

00:56:38.970 --> 00:56:40.970
I am Hohsalle Yuguraul!

00:56:41.640 --> 00:56:45.010
Let us make a deal.
I shall accompany you.

00:56:45.510 --> 00:56:50.520
I will tend to your wounds.
You have lost too much precious blood.

00:56:51.190 --> 00:56:56.150
However, once you achieve your aim,
you shall let me take some.

00:56:56.270 --> 00:56:57.360
Fair?

00:56:57.690 --> 00:57:02.910
Tracker! You are needed too,
to find the girl called Yuna.

00:57:03.780 --> 00:57:07.330
All is settled. Van,
I shall redress your wounds.

00:57:07.490 --> 00:57:08.750
Get down.

00:57:12.540 --> 00:57:15.420
Let's see your shoulder.
I shall treat it too.

00:57:29.350 --> 00:57:33.730
<i>And so, I came to travel
with the man who holds the key.</i>

00:57:34.560 --> 00:57:39.030
<i>Strange as it is,
the woman who wants his head</i>

00:57:39.400 --> 00:57:42.240
<i>has become our navigator...</i>

00:57:58.800 --> 00:57:59.880
Shall we rest?

00:58:00.260 --> 00:58:02.590
Not until the next forest.

00:58:03.130 --> 00:58:05.390
This is avalanche country.

00:58:10.180 --> 00:58:11.270
Amazing.

00:58:11.930 --> 00:58:13.600
His wounds have closed.

00:58:14.690 --> 00:58:18.110
I shall hunt for food.
Find firewood, sir.

00:58:18.230 --> 00:58:19.150
Me?

00:58:28.410 --> 00:58:29.990
That won't do.

00:58:31.160 --> 00:58:33.410
Damp wood burns poorly.

00:58:34.080 --> 00:58:36.630
We need branches from trees.

00:58:43.590 --> 00:58:45.800
Will this do, my teacher?

00:58:49.140 --> 00:58:50.810
You want my blood?

00:58:52.430 --> 00:58:53.390
Yes.

00:58:53.520 --> 00:58:54.640
Why?

00:58:56.020 --> 00:58:57.230
<i>Well...</i>

00:58:58.310 --> 00:59:02.230
<i>A disease called mittsual
plagues this land.</i>

00:59:03.070 --> 00:59:05.280
<i>It is spread by ossam dogs.</i>

00:59:06.070 --> 00:59:08.740
<i>One bit you in the salt mine, right?</i>

00:59:10.120 --> 00:59:15.500
As you have survived,
your blood may provide a cure.

00:59:15.750 --> 00:59:18.460
My blood, curing a disease?

00:59:19.670 --> 00:59:21.880
<i>Take snakebites for example.</i>

00:59:22.460 --> 00:59:27.760
<i>We dilute blood of the previously bitten
and transfuse patients with it.</i>

00:59:28.590 --> 00:59:32.760
<i>That blood remembers
how to fight the poison,</i>

00:59:32.930 --> 00:59:35.980
<i>and weakens the snakebite's effect.</i>

00:59:37.850 --> 00:59:42.360
<i>In other words, your blood,
which defeated the mittsual,</i>

00:59:43.650 --> 00:59:47.320
<i>will become a
powerful weapon to fight it.</i>

00:59:50.490 --> 00:59:54.040
I wish to wield that weapon
against the disease.

00:59:54.910 --> 00:59:57.290
I have indeed survived.

00:59:57.790 --> 01:00:03.340
But I did not defeat it.
The disease still lives within me.

01:00:03.800 --> 01:00:08.550
Or rather, the disease may be
what is keeping me alive.

01:00:19.890 --> 01:00:21.860
<i>"Keeping me alive"...</i>

01:00:22.690 --> 01:00:24.730
<i>What an odd thing to say.</i>

01:00:25.730 --> 01:00:29.200
<i>I have seen the mittsual
take many lives.</i>

01:00:29.990 --> 01:00:35.290
<i>What face has it adopted
while living within this man?</i>

01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:40.920
<i>I felt an urge to look upon that face.</i>

01:00:43.130 --> 01:00:43.920
Van.

01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:48.470
This Yuna you risk your life for
is your wife?

01:00:48.800 --> 01:00:53.260
My wife died in an epidemic.
My son as well.

01:00:54.010 --> 01:00:55.430
Then Yuna is...

01:00:57.270 --> 01:00:58.430
My daughter.

01:01:20.790 --> 01:01:25.250
<i>He heals remarkably fast.
The Lone Antlers' strength?</i>

01:01:26.460 --> 01:01:28.420
<i>Or perhaps the mittsual?</i>

01:01:30.470 --> 01:01:33.590
<i>I may be a vaunted sacred doctor,</i>

01:01:34.800 --> 01:01:38.140
<i>but here I eat parasite-laden meat...</i>

01:01:41.140 --> 01:01:42.940
May I borrow that?

01:02:14.180 --> 01:02:15.510
<i>My daughter.</i>

01:02:45.460 --> 01:02:47.460
Woman! Where is Van?

01:02:48.460 --> 01:02:50.420
Grazing his pyuika.

01:03:02.680 --> 01:03:06.100
<i>Humans cannot see
within their bodies.</i>

01:03:06.230 --> 01:03:09.650
<i>But now you are Inside Out,
you have become aware.</i>

01:03:09.770 --> 01:03:12.360
<i>Souls and bodies
are separate things.</i>

01:03:12.440 --> 01:03:15.200
<i>All living creatures
are at one with each other.</i>

01:03:15.320 --> 01:03:19.120
<i>Your body is merely
an anchoring vessel.</i>

01:03:19.240 --> 01:03:22.370
<i>Having been bitten by a dog,
what did you see?</i>

01:03:23.500 --> 01:03:25.080
Do not fear the light.

01:03:25.660 --> 01:03:27.790
You are a free being.

01:03:32.170 --> 01:03:33.050
Van.

01:03:33.550 --> 01:03:35.800
What is it? Your wounds aching?

01:03:36.050 --> 01:03:40.720
No. Sometimes I hear the voice
of the man who took Yuna.

01:03:41.350 --> 01:03:46.480
His voice is somehow reassuring.
That frightens me.

01:03:51.440 --> 01:03:53.940
Come. Yuna is waiting.

01:03:54.940 --> 01:03:55.690
Okay.

01:04:05.120 --> 01:04:10.210
In the west here, anti-Zol sentiment
remains strong.

01:04:10.960 --> 01:04:13.500
So, you are from the west?

01:04:22.970 --> 01:04:27.680
Are you sure you will not greet
His Majesty the Emperor?

01:04:28.440 --> 01:04:33.020
Quite sure.
He has no interest in me now.

01:04:33.770 --> 01:04:37.610
Come. I shall fulfill my duty
as an imperial prince.

01:04:39.610 --> 01:04:43.780
A decree for us to join
their military campaign?

01:04:44.490 --> 01:04:48.710
We also need to prevent rebellion,
per our treaty.

01:04:49.790 --> 01:04:51.170
How dastardly...

01:04:51.290 --> 01:04:55.460
Who said that Yotalu
would make Zol easier to control?

01:04:55.630 --> 01:04:57.050
My apologies.

01:04:58.010 --> 01:04:59.760
What should we do?

01:05:00.130 --> 01:05:01.970
Obey the decree.

01:05:02.640 --> 01:05:06.680
We must avoid
falling foul of the emperor.

01:05:07.220 --> 01:05:10.980
Drat and blast.
How did this happen to us?

01:05:11.190 --> 01:05:13.690
I have no excuse to offer.

01:05:13.810 --> 01:05:17.610
However, even if we lose
Fire Horse Village,

01:05:17.820 --> 01:05:22.490
if we can just keep the ossam alive,
then one day...

01:05:22.660 --> 01:05:25.200
That day is far away.

01:05:25.490 --> 01:05:29.120
A love of country
nurtures hope for the future.

01:05:29.660 --> 01:05:31.500
What about Hohsalle?

01:05:31.670 --> 01:05:37.170
If he finds a cure,
that future will also vanish.

01:05:39.050 --> 01:05:43.340
The key to all of this
is that man from the salt mine.

01:05:46.010 --> 01:05:49.270
If we could
remove him from the equation...

01:05:55.690 --> 01:05:58.070
Rumors of the mittsual's return

01:05:58.230 --> 01:06:00.940
have reignited smoldering anger at

01:06:01.110 --> 01:06:04.570
the resumption of
the Emperor's Eyes' Visit.

01:06:05.240 --> 01:06:09.370
This was originally Aquafa's land.
Zol deserves punishment.

01:06:10.200 --> 01:06:15.250
The lord and his wife
were truly good and kind.

01:06:15.500 --> 01:06:20.800
Our village prospered thanks to them.
This is foolishness...

01:06:21.340 --> 01:06:23.380
Hey, where's my mother?

01:06:31.640 --> 01:06:33.600
An Aquafaese curse...

01:06:34.100 --> 01:06:38.110
Many say it is
divine punishment for Zol...

01:06:38.440 --> 01:06:39.570
Time to go.

01:06:44.910 --> 01:06:49.080
I pray another war
does not break out.

01:06:55.620 --> 01:06:58.130
Why did I survive?

01:07:09.350 --> 01:07:10.680
<i>The mittsual...</i>

01:07:11.350 --> 01:07:15.940
<i>...kills Zolians but not Aquafaese
for a reason, I'm sure.</i>

01:07:17.350 --> 01:07:19.400
<i>Destiny plays no part.</i>

01:07:20.110 --> 01:07:24.650
<i>If we look closely,
we find hidden threads of causality.</i>

01:07:25.320 --> 01:07:29.370
<i>Following those threads
will save many lives.</i>

01:07:30.620 --> 01:07:34.200
<i>Trusting in that is the basis
of the medical arts.</i>

01:07:41.750 --> 01:07:42.630
Van.

01:07:43.300 --> 01:07:47.180
There also must be a reason
why you survived.

01:07:50.300 --> 01:07:55.730
Do your medical arts save the body?
Or the soul?

01:07:56.060 --> 01:07:58.980
Saving the body saves the soul.

01:07:59.980 --> 01:08:03.570
My soul was saved by Yuna.

01:08:08.610 --> 01:08:09.740
<i>His soul...</i>

01:08:10.990 --> 01:08:13.030
<i>The soul he speaks of</i>

01:08:13.660 --> 01:08:18.670
<i>sounds different to that which
the priest-doctors mention.</i>

01:08:48.860 --> 01:08:52.320
A guide for the emperor's balloon.

01:08:54.370 --> 01:08:55.620
The Emperor's Eyes' Visit?

01:08:57.540 --> 01:08:59.250
Then we are near...

01:09:00.040 --> 01:09:03.880
Yes. Fire Horse Village lies ahead.

01:09:05.210 --> 01:09:07.920
Once sacred,
it was protected by the mittsual.

01:09:08.800 --> 01:09:11.720
Is this...another thread of causality?

01:09:24.440 --> 01:09:28.110
I can no longer hear their voices.

01:09:42.290 --> 01:09:44.750
Those youths got bitten again?

01:09:45.040 --> 01:09:49.340
Yes. It seems they snuck into
the precincts at night.

01:09:51.930 --> 01:09:56.430
And yet they are incapable of
receiving the power...

01:09:57.600 --> 01:10:00.140
They wished to repay you,
Chief Ohfan.

01:10:00.810 --> 01:10:01.980
Fools...

01:10:03.980 --> 01:10:06.150
They wanted to be king.

01:10:25.290 --> 01:10:26.840
Dismount now.

01:10:45.730 --> 01:10:46.860
Stilt-walker!

01:10:50.690 --> 01:10:51.530
Upper left!

01:11:34.190 --> 01:11:38.370
Why?! We are fellow Aquafaese!
Why attack us?!

01:11:52.210 --> 01:11:55.130
Fear and hate blind people.

01:11:56.220 --> 01:11:58.340
I was the same once.

01:12:02.100 --> 01:12:07.020
Actually, years ago,
I encountered "Broken Antler" Van.

01:12:08.560 --> 01:12:12.610
A mere six Lone Antlers
had decimated my squadron.

01:12:13.230 --> 01:12:15.030
Lucky you survived.

01:12:15.940 --> 01:12:18.950
Well, he would not kill a boy,
as I was.

01:12:42.600 --> 01:12:46.890
Apologies for resting here.
It is not doctorly of me.

01:12:49.100 --> 01:12:52.650
Van, may I ask a question?

01:12:53.650 --> 01:12:56.650
This Yuna you seek.
What is she like?

01:13:00.110 --> 01:13:02.530
Well, Yuna is...

01:13:03.200 --> 01:13:08.080
Her hands are small,
soft, and clingy.

01:13:08.660 --> 01:13:11.790
Her cheeks are rosy,
round, and warm.

01:13:11.960 --> 01:13:13.960
Her hair is slightly unruly.

01:13:14.130 --> 01:13:18.920
Yes. Tying it into pigtails
makes her smile with delight.

01:13:19.550 --> 01:13:23.470
She loves to smile.
She is fond of animals.

01:13:23.640 --> 01:13:25.970
Insects? Perhaps not.

01:13:26.970 --> 01:13:31.690
She loves pyuika milk
and milks them well.

01:13:32.150 --> 01:13:34.610
She makes meat taste better.

01:13:35.020 --> 01:13:40.030
She cannot chew well,
but she fills her mouth and smiles.

01:13:40.740 --> 01:13:44.490
When sleeping, she sometimes
clings to my back.

01:13:44.870 --> 01:13:47.490
So tightly that it hurts a little.

01:13:48.290 --> 01:13:51.620
I thought I would never
be a father again...

01:13:52.540 --> 01:13:55.340
I want to show her many things.

01:13:56.170 --> 01:14:00.170
I want to see her grow,
find a man she loves,

01:14:00.300 --> 01:14:03.010
marry him, and...

01:14:03.680 --> 01:14:07.720
I want to keep watching over her.

01:14:09.680 --> 01:14:11.020
A deer whistle?

01:14:13.730 --> 01:14:14.560
Yes.

01:14:16.860 --> 01:14:19.070
She is not your child.

01:14:24.160 --> 01:14:25.030
Thank you.

01:14:27.580 --> 01:14:33.580
She is an orphan who was given to
an insane woman in the salt mine.

01:14:34.460 --> 01:14:35.250
Yeah.

01:14:36.210 --> 01:14:38.590
But blood ties matter not.

01:14:39.380 --> 01:14:42.050
She is my daughter.

01:14:43.880 --> 01:14:47.220
You say things
a tracker could never see.

01:14:48.510 --> 01:14:52.390
Go northwest of this hot-spring region,
and follow the valley.

01:14:53.060 --> 01:14:57.770
Fire Horse Village lies beyond.
The ossam will be there...

01:14:58.110 --> 01:14:59.230
With your daughter.

01:15:00.610 --> 01:15:03.110
Why bring us this far?

01:15:03.950 --> 01:15:06.780
She also survived the mittsual.

01:15:09.200 --> 01:15:11.240
I was going to kill you both.

01:15:14.790 --> 01:15:15.790
Leaving?

01:15:16.920 --> 01:15:20.750
You left a good village.
Take her back.

01:15:21.880 --> 01:15:27.260
I am Sae. The next time we meet,
call me by that name.

01:16:13.180 --> 01:16:16.480
<i>When I awoke,
the woman was gone.</i>

01:16:17.480 --> 01:16:23.480
<i>Van said I need not follow him, but I
refused, still wanting his blood.</i>

01:16:24.690 --> 01:16:28.490
<i>What in the world did I see
the night before?</i>

01:16:29.860 --> 01:16:34.040
Van. Please let me hear
the sound that whistle makes.

01:16:49.340 --> 01:16:51.680
Not quite what I expected.

01:17:03.730 --> 01:17:05.530
Yuna awaits beyond.

01:17:05.610 --> 01:17:06.400
Yes...

01:17:06.740 --> 01:17:08.360
The land deeply tied to the mittsual...

01:17:14.740 --> 01:17:16.750
Hey! Wait for me!

01:17:24.750 --> 01:17:29.380
<i>You have come at last, Van.
I have been waiting.</i>

01:17:39.770 --> 01:17:45.110
<i>With your power, become one
with the village's remaining ossam.</i>

01:17:45.570 --> 01:17:48.400
<i>They are our very future.</i>

01:17:49.110 --> 01:17:53.070
<i>Come, Van.
You shall be my successor...</i>

01:18:10.920 --> 01:18:15.260
Rest easy.
I shall treat the doctor as my guest.

01:18:18.970 --> 01:18:22.810
I worried you would not make it,
"Broken Antler" Van...

01:18:23.270 --> 01:18:24.980
leader of the Lone Antlers.

01:18:25.810 --> 01:18:29.610
I am Ohfan,
chief of Fire Horse Village.

01:18:31.110 --> 01:18:32.320
Where is Yuna?

01:18:34.990 --> 01:18:35.990
Follow me.

01:19:11.190 --> 01:19:12.030
Chief Ohfan!

01:19:13.030 --> 01:19:15.860
Zolians are encamped on the Nagori plain.

01:19:15.990 --> 01:19:16.780
I see.

01:19:17.320 --> 01:19:20.540
Rest up for tomorrow.
Tell the others.

01:19:20.580 --> 01:19:21.410
Yes, sir!

01:19:26.670 --> 01:19:30.170
My people have
gone into hiding elsewhere.

01:19:30.500 --> 01:19:35.010
Tomorrow, the Zolian army
will swarm in.

01:19:35.680 --> 01:19:37.680
This view will be gone.

01:19:41.010 --> 01:19:42.390
H-Hey!

01:19:44.560 --> 01:19:46.060
What is it, Olaha?

01:20:05.500 --> 01:20:09.210
Did you know pyuika
have fire horse blood?

01:20:11.920 --> 01:20:17.380
We forgot about them - even how to
breed them - yet they gather here.

01:20:17.680 --> 01:20:20.220
This land is sacred to them too.

01:20:20.720 --> 01:20:25.100
What say you?
Why not reclaim this realm with me?

01:20:26.100 --> 01:20:28.940
<i>Van? Van!</i>

01:20:29.600 --> 01:20:30.730
Pretty, right?

01:20:31.610 --> 01:20:32.610
Right?

01:20:35.940 --> 01:20:36.950
Who are you?

01:20:38.450 --> 01:20:39.740
Pretty, right?

01:20:40.570 --> 01:20:41.580
Pretty?

01:20:41.740 --> 01:20:43.410
They're glowing!

01:20:44.740 --> 01:20:45.910
The asshimi?

01:20:48.250 --> 01:20:49.120
You are...

01:20:50.580 --> 01:20:51.590
...Yuna?!

01:21:01.430 --> 01:21:02.100
Ossam?!

01:21:02.260 --> 01:21:05.430
You cannot enter those precincts.

01:21:06.310 --> 01:21:08.640
We meet again, Sir Hohsalle.

01:21:09.440 --> 01:21:13.150
We studied together in Otawalle.
I am Shikan.

01:21:14.320 --> 01:21:16.150
I need your help.

01:21:17.570 --> 01:21:18.990
Last autumn,

01:21:19.110 --> 01:21:23.620
the King of Aquafa's right-hand man
visited this village.

01:21:23.990 --> 01:21:29.160
He said Emperor Natalu would resume
the Emperor's Eyes' Visit.

01:21:30.620 --> 01:21:36.420
They no longer feared the mittsual
that protected this village.

01:21:37.460 --> 01:21:41.470
That is why Kenoi
chose to lead the ossam again...

01:21:41.640 --> 01:21:45.810
to remind the Zolians
why they should be afraid.

01:21:46.470 --> 01:21:51.520
Unfortunately, the Dog King
is elderly, and his power wanes...

01:21:52.190 --> 01:21:55.360
A successor must take up his mantle.

01:21:55.770 --> 01:22:01.360
It cannot be me.
The mittsual chose...you, Van!

01:22:05.490 --> 01:22:08.200
Is this...the mittsual's doing?

01:22:08.830 --> 01:22:09.450
Yes.

01:22:09.560 --> 01:22:12.460
But these are Aquafaese, no?

01:22:12.670 --> 01:22:18.170
They are. They should be immune,
but they have been infected.

01:22:18.340 --> 01:22:19.170
Why?

01:22:19.800 --> 01:22:20.840
I do not know.

01:22:21.170 --> 01:22:26.180
They are former captives of Zol,
raised in their villages.

01:22:26.850 --> 01:22:31.730
<i>Could that be the reason?
Or has the disease mutated?</i>

01:22:33.060 --> 01:22:35.230
<i>The ossam bit them?</i>

01:22:35.400 --> 01:22:36.400
<i>Yes.</i>

01:22:36.570 --> 01:22:42.570
Ohfan freed them, so they tried to
repay him, getting bitten voluntarily...

01:22:42.860 --> 01:22:46.070
Voluntarily?
Why get bitten on purpose?

01:22:47.030 --> 01:22:49.540
To receive the Dog King's power.

01:22:49.700 --> 01:22:50.870
The Dog King...?

01:22:51.540 --> 01:22:55.540
Ossam can only be led
by a human who is bitten

01:22:55.710 --> 01:22:59.090
and survives upon
receiving a special power.

01:22:59.880 --> 01:23:02.380
<i>Why did I survive?</i>

01:23:04.550 --> 01:23:05.890
You mean, Van?!

01:23:06.300 --> 01:23:06.970
Yes.

01:23:07.220 --> 01:23:10.060
A successor has been found?

01:23:11.600 --> 01:23:13.600
We were not worthy...

01:23:14.770 --> 01:23:17.440
I see... A successor...

01:23:17.900 --> 01:23:20.730
Congratulations, Chief Ohfan...

01:23:25.590 --> 01:23:26.410
Boil water.

01:23:26.980 --> 01:23:27.450
What?

01:23:27.790 --> 01:23:28.630
Do you have ikimi?

01:23:28.910 --> 01:23:30.290
A little...

01:23:30.580 --> 01:23:33.200
An alternative also exists.
Get it!

01:23:33.290 --> 01:23:34.080
On it!

01:23:34.750 --> 01:23:38.130
<i>Damn! Where is Van now?</i>

01:23:45.930 --> 01:23:47.760
Hey! Move it, newcomer!

01:23:54.310 --> 01:23:55.640
That woman...

01:23:56.810 --> 01:23:58.480
Hey! The pot!

01:24:00.320 --> 01:24:02.320
You disobeyed my order?

01:24:02.650 --> 01:24:03.490
I did.

01:24:04.110 --> 01:24:08.490
Letting that man live
will nullify the mittsual's threat.

01:24:08.620 --> 01:24:11.950
You know very well
what that will mean.

01:24:13.160 --> 01:24:16.160
You have failed me.
Take her away!

01:24:16.290 --> 01:24:17.000
Yes, sir!

01:24:20.630 --> 01:24:21.630
Get up.

01:24:27.300 --> 01:24:29.140
Is that the tracker woman?

01:24:30.640 --> 01:24:32.970
Yes. She lost the salt mine escapee.

01:24:33.140 --> 01:24:34.180
She what?

01:24:36.350 --> 01:24:40.690
Now we can only watch as
the Emperor's Eyes' Visit proceeds.

01:24:40.860 --> 01:24:42.860
I shall silence Ohfan.

01:24:43.320 --> 01:24:45.190
And abandon the village?

01:24:45.320 --> 01:24:46.360
Yes.

01:24:46.490 --> 01:24:50.200
We must gaze at
the emperor's smiling face?

01:24:50.990 --> 01:24:53.540
We shall sacrifice too much.

01:24:57.790 --> 01:24:59.370
Woman! Where is he?!

01:24:59.670 --> 01:25:00.830
What are you...?!

01:25:01.000 --> 01:25:03.000
Where is Sir Hohsalle?!

01:25:03.210 --> 01:25:04.210
Stop that!

01:25:04.340 --> 01:25:07.010
Move! I need to ask that woman!

01:25:13.510 --> 01:25:14.850
H-Help!

01:25:20.400 --> 01:25:24.230
Sir Hohsalle and Van
are at Fire Horse Village.

01:25:24.570 --> 01:25:27.360
Follow the cliffs three leagues north.

01:25:27.740 --> 01:25:30.860
There is a secret path to the village.

01:25:50.430 --> 01:25:52.220
Dawn has broken.

01:25:53.430 --> 01:25:56.350
Pyuika milk.
It will nourish you.

01:25:57.390 --> 01:26:02.810
The villagers here drink it.
All Aquafaese once drank it.

01:26:03.610 --> 01:26:08.400
Being captives of Zol
made these youths hate the smell.

01:26:08.610 --> 01:26:10.950
I wish I could nourish them...

01:26:12.160 --> 01:26:13.660
Chief Ohfan!

01:26:24.830 --> 01:26:25.920
Van!

01:26:29.760 --> 01:26:31.340
You the sacred doctor?

01:26:31.760 --> 01:26:34.390
Know this. The mittsual sent

01:26:34.510 --> 01:26:39.310
former Lone Antlers' leader Van
to this land as its new king.

01:26:39.810 --> 01:26:41.640
It is the gods' will.

01:26:41.810 --> 01:26:45.360
The disease only lets
the chosen ones live.

01:26:46.110 --> 01:26:49.650
No! It is a mere disease.
Not the gods' will.

01:26:50.150 --> 01:26:53.530
Van's blood can save those youths!

01:26:55.490 --> 01:26:59.120
I see... So you also seek this man?

01:27:00.660 --> 01:27:01.660
Very well.

01:27:01.790 --> 01:27:06.630
All can be decided when
he becomes the Dog King.

01:27:07.290 --> 01:27:11.460
Go! Kenoi awaits you.
Your daughter is with him.

01:27:11.670 --> 01:27:13.760
No. Do not go, Van!

01:27:21.930 --> 01:27:25.060
It is true that the disease
seems godly.

01:27:25.850 --> 01:27:31.940
It is unclear when or why it will infect,
or why it kills some and spares others.

01:27:32.530 --> 01:27:35.240
It is far beyond our grasp.

01:27:35.780 --> 01:27:39.450
Even so...
does that justify giving up?!

01:27:40.330 --> 01:27:42.370
It may seem to be destiny,

01:27:42.540 --> 01:27:46.630
but resisting destiny
is how we survive, is it not?!

01:27:49.000 --> 01:27:52.090
I am satisfied with my destiny.

01:27:52.800 --> 01:27:57.510
Natalu, Emperor of Zol...
I'd gladly give my life to end his.

01:28:17.200 --> 01:28:20.200
Answer me.
Are you willing, Van?

01:28:21.740 --> 01:28:25.710
Amid darkness,
the mittsual found you.

01:28:25.790 --> 01:28:28.920
Use it as the Dog King
to remake our world!

01:28:30.040 --> 01:28:33.420
As your soul surely desires.

01:28:34.510 --> 01:28:39.260
After losing my wife and child,
I groveled in darkness.

01:28:40.300 --> 01:28:43.720
But Yuna brought me back
from the abyss.

01:28:44.850 --> 01:28:48.020
My soul was saved by that child.

01:28:51.270 --> 01:28:52.230
Yuna!

01:28:53.570 --> 01:28:56.320
This girl is favored by the ossam.

01:28:56.490 --> 01:29:00.660
She also gained the power
to become their queen.

01:29:01.620 --> 01:29:03.910
This is the answer you seek.

01:29:05.790 --> 01:29:07.750
Give in to it, Van!

01:29:09.250 --> 01:29:10.250
No.

01:29:12.250 --> 01:29:14.750
This is no place for her to live.

01:29:15.710 --> 01:29:20.090
To live on with her,
I shall continue to resist!

01:29:22.930 --> 01:29:24.760
I shall not be the Dog King!

01:29:32.060 --> 01:29:33.270
Why not?!

01:29:34.980 --> 01:29:40.030
If you shall not,
why do you possess that power?!

01:30:11.520 --> 01:30:12.560
Dada?

01:30:19.320 --> 01:30:20.740
You're back.

01:30:27.660 --> 01:30:28.870
Sir Hohsalle!

01:30:30.330 --> 01:30:32.210
At last, I found you!

01:30:32.710 --> 01:30:34.170
How did you...?

01:30:34.330 --> 01:30:37.590
Hurry! This is our
chance to escape!

01:30:39.260 --> 01:30:41.260
Er, where is that Van fellow?

01:30:46.140 --> 01:30:47.180
Van!

01:30:57.570 --> 01:30:58.570
Yuna.

01:31:00.530 --> 01:31:01.570
Worry not.

01:31:03.320 --> 01:31:04.780
Indeed, I mean no harm.

01:31:05.740 --> 01:31:09.080
I brought this just in case.
Is it useful?

01:31:10.370 --> 01:31:14.670
How thoughtful! And unlike you.
Well done.

01:31:15.750 --> 01:31:18.090
Get the sickest youth's blood.

01:31:18.170 --> 01:31:18.880
On it.

01:31:19.340 --> 01:31:21.670
Diluted poison for the rest.

01:31:25.010 --> 01:31:28.220
Relax. I shall take only a little.

01:31:35.600 --> 01:31:36.610
It's pretty!

01:31:37.110 --> 01:31:39.770
She said the same about asshimi...

01:31:44.360 --> 01:31:46.780
She was bitten too?!

01:32:21.820 --> 01:32:22.980
<i>Kenoi...</i>

01:32:24.150 --> 01:32:25.360
Mount up!

01:32:38.920 --> 01:32:42.670
Succeed...me...

01:32:52.100 --> 01:32:53.680
What is going on?

01:33:03.440 --> 01:33:07.030
Makokan! Stand down.

01:33:08.200 --> 01:33:09.200
Sir Hohsalle!

01:33:10.490 --> 01:33:12.490
Stop this, Van.

01:33:12.660 --> 01:33:15.500
The mittsual must not perish...

01:33:15.910 --> 01:33:16.580
- My husband.

01:33:18.440 --> 01:33:19.030
- Father.

01:33:23.170 --> 01:33:24.460
Be strong.

01:33:24.590 --> 01:33:26.800
Remember who you are.

01:33:28.090 --> 01:33:29.510
My family...

01:33:34.510 --> 01:33:35.560
I have no choice!

01:33:41.730 --> 01:33:43.060
Sir Hohsalle!

01:33:44.520 --> 01:33:45.400
Forgive me.

01:33:50.910 --> 01:33:51.910
Yuna!

01:34:04.210 --> 01:34:05.250
It can't be...

01:34:21.940 --> 01:34:24.560
Sir Hohsalle! The youths are...

01:35:05.270 --> 01:35:06.310
Olaha!

01:35:32.630 --> 01:35:35.590
The lightning did no damage to our forces.

01:35:35.680 --> 01:35:36.300
Line up!

01:35:36.640 --> 01:35:40.810
Assume battle formation,
and when the time comes,

01:35:40.970 --> 01:35:43.020
blast open the valley...

01:35:46.650 --> 01:35:47.860
What the...?!

01:35:48.520 --> 01:35:50.690
It is not yet time!

01:36:05.170 --> 01:36:06.580
Alright! This youth first.

01:36:07.170 --> 01:36:08.500
This one next.

01:36:11.880 --> 01:36:13.260
<i>Think, Hohsalle.</i>

01:36:14.340 --> 01:36:16.510
<i>What must I learn?</i>

01:36:18.350 --> 01:36:19.890
Huh? An attack?!

01:36:26.560 --> 01:36:29.270
Foolish followers of Zol!

01:36:29.560 --> 01:36:33.110
We shall bring you to your senses!

01:36:39.620 --> 01:36:43.250
Now, let them taste our
loyalty to the emperor!

01:36:43.580 --> 01:36:48.210
<i>The dogs are not with you...
A wise choice, Ohfan.</i>

01:36:48.380 --> 01:36:53.210
<i>Pray for the future they beget...
from the next world!</i>

01:37:00.890 --> 01:37:02.260
Tohlim!

01:37:13.570 --> 01:37:14.610
Yuna...

01:37:27.580 --> 01:37:30.750
The king!
Defend the king!

01:37:32.090 --> 01:37:34.800
Who's a right-hand man now?

01:37:38.970 --> 01:37:40.090
M-My allies!

01:37:41.050 --> 01:37:44.970
Dogs?! He brought them?
That fool!

01:37:47.480 --> 01:37:48.390
So be it!

01:37:49.640 --> 01:37:53.320
Onward! Take the head of
Emperor Natalu!

01:38:05.620 --> 01:38:07.500
<i>So you are the new queen...</i>

01:38:13.460 --> 01:38:14.380
Draw arms!

01:38:14.700 --> 01:38:15.630
Dogs!

01:38:15.800 --> 01:38:17.130
Wretched dogs!

01:38:17.300 --> 01:38:18.060
The mittsual!

01:38:18.180 --> 01:38:19.840
The Aquafaese curse!

01:38:31.810 --> 01:38:35.150
Anything to drink...
Oh! Thank goodness!

01:38:37.320 --> 01:38:38.360
What is this?!

01:38:38.490 --> 01:38:39.650
Pyuika milk.

01:38:39.820 --> 01:38:43.700
<i>She loves pyuika milk,
and milks them well.</i>

01:38:46.030 --> 01:38:50.870
<i>All Aquafaese once drank it.
These youths hate the smell.</i>

01:38:51.120 --> 01:38:55.840
<i>Before being occupied by Zol,
Aquafaese drank pyuika milk.</i>

01:38:57.000 --> 01:38:58.170
<i>Van and Yuna too...</i>

01:38:59.340 --> 01:39:01.380
<i>Zolians never did.</i>

01:39:03.180 --> 01:39:07.970
<i>Aquafaese under Zolian rule
abandoned the custom.</i>

01:39:13.560 --> 01:39:14.850
<i>They're glowing!</i>

01:39:23.070 --> 01:39:28.450
<i>Glowing asshimi. Van's blood.
Linked by pyuika milk...</i>

01:39:32.120 --> 01:39:34.920
<i>Van's glowing blood
has mittsual antibodies...</i>

01:39:36.630 --> 01:39:37.750
<i>That's it!</i>

01:39:38.880 --> 01:39:43.380
<i>Asshimi enables the production
of mittsual antibodies!</i>

01:40:29.140 --> 01:40:30.310
Hold your fire!

01:40:38.150 --> 01:40:39.980
Come with me, Yuna.

01:40:42.940 --> 01:40:43.780
Yuna.

01:40:44.440 --> 01:40:45.570
Dada?

01:40:52.410 --> 01:40:57.460
Enough. I am more than ready to die.

01:40:58.960 --> 01:41:00.840
Go, my queen.

01:41:01.460 --> 01:41:05.170
Run through the forest,
and however long it takes,

01:41:05.300 --> 01:41:10.550
use the disease to kill
every last Zolian!

01:41:38.370 --> 01:41:39.620
Send the horses!

01:41:40.210 --> 01:41:41.250
Van...

01:41:41.670 --> 01:41:44.800
No escape!
Hunt down those dogs!

01:41:45.590 --> 01:41:46.970
Shoot that man.

01:41:47.010 --> 01:41:47.720
What?

01:41:48.510 --> 01:41:51.180
The pyuika rider.
Do it now.

01:41:51.220 --> 01:41:52.850
Y-Yes, sire.

01:42:00.730 --> 01:42:02.270
That woman?!

01:42:17.700 --> 01:42:19.830
Why help that man escape?!

01:42:43.770 --> 01:42:48.280
Where are you going?!
The battlefield is not our place...

01:42:50.450 --> 01:42:51.820
Not again!

01:42:57.080 --> 01:42:59.450
Olaha, I beg you!
Dig deep!

01:43:06.460 --> 01:43:07.590
Yuna!

01:43:07.920 --> 01:43:09.050
Dada!

01:43:37.780 --> 01:43:39.200
I found you!

01:43:47.130 --> 01:43:48.630
I like you too!

01:44:15.860 --> 01:44:16.990
Dada?

01:44:29.130 --> 01:44:31.670
Yuna, thank you.

01:44:32.510 --> 01:44:33.260
Dada?

01:44:34.970 --> 01:44:37.890
Return to the village.
They await you.

01:44:39.510 --> 01:44:41.600
Tohma and the others?

01:44:43.850 --> 01:44:45.270
I promised you this.

01:44:53.400 --> 01:44:56.110
You will go on to meet many people.

01:44:57.410 --> 01:44:59.570
Your place is with them.

01:45:02.040 --> 01:45:03.540
And you, Dada?

01:45:26.060 --> 01:45:27.270
Dada?

01:45:31.440 --> 01:45:32.570
Wait!

01:45:33.230 --> 01:45:37.070
No! I'll go with you!

01:45:42.080 --> 01:45:45.620
Take me!
I'll go back with you!

01:45:50.250 --> 01:45:51.670
Where's Dada?

01:45:59.840 --> 01:46:02.550
When will Dada come back?

01:46:23.780 --> 01:46:26.950
Wh-What was that?

01:46:37.960 --> 01:46:42.510
Dr. Hohsalle Yuguraul,
of the Otawalle Academy!

01:46:42.640 --> 01:46:46.140
He has returned
with a cure for the mittsual!

01:46:46.310 --> 01:46:49.140
Hey, hey!
Don't make that face.

01:46:50.480 --> 01:46:54.230
Is it true that you have found a cure?

01:46:54.690 --> 01:46:58.190
Yes. But if troops push on
into Fire Horse Village,

01:46:59.030 --> 01:47:00.900
it will be lost to us.

01:47:01.780 --> 01:47:02.860
Retreat, you say?

01:47:04.490 --> 01:47:10.040
Even if you do, the Emperor's Eyes'
Visit will not end in defeat.

01:47:11.160 --> 01:47:13.170
Please believe in me...

01:47:13.710 --> 01:47:16.800
and that man named Van.

01:53:08.860 --> 01:53:13.680
THE DEER KING

01:53:14.320 --> 01:53:16.320
Additional Translation
Jake Jung
